            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mFVcz",
              "name": "A run is what agister run leaves: a requ",
              "context": "p",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 107.5,
              "content": "A run is what agister run leaves: a request that resolved, every step called on its runtime in a worktree Agister holds, and a record of who did what with what. Settings say what may run; this page says how it runs. The settings architecture is the half before it; the facts behind each part are in run-implementation.md.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
              "fontSize": 16.8,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
