                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 535.2,
                          "content": "a line per event as it happens: a step started, reused, a tool call, a stale turn, a turn at capacity, a fallback, a step ended; a branch's arm with each condition read, its values and whether it held; a repeat's pass with its state; why a repeat stopped; a child run started, with its params and inputs, and ended, with its status and output",
