            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Am1lu",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 16.5,
              "layout": "none"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DRO16",
              "name": "Progress goes to stderr as it happens: a",
              "context": "p",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 76.78,
              "content": "Progress goes to stderr as it happens: a line per step started and ended, · <branch>: took <arm>, · <repeat>: ended pass <n> and · <repeat>: stopped <why> after <n> passes; the result, on stdout, is JSON. agister runs export copies a run out.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "zwJEO",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 36,
              "layout": "none"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tbAzV",
              "name": "Running again",
              "context": "h2",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "content": "Running again",
              "lineHeight": 1.25,
              "fontFamily": "Iowan Old Style",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "AYwxa",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 8,
              "layout": "none"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uqv10",
              "name": "--reuse <run id> runs a request again an",
              "context": "p",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 127.97,
              "content": "--reuse <run id> runs a request again and takes an earlier call of the same name, and pass, in place of making it, where its process, agent, inputs, definitions and environment are the same and the worktree is as that call left it. A call that continues a session, or whose session is continued, is made again. --continue <run id> goes on in the session of a one-step run's call.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "X8KYVh",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 36,
              "layout": "none"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "jugn8",
              "name": "What Agister does not do",
              "context": "h2",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "content": "What Agister does not do",
              "lineHeight": 1.25,
              "fontFamily": "Iowan Old Style",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qTirk",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 8,
              "layout": "none"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "WwRwF",
              "name": "Agister runs what settings define and re",
              "context": "p",
              "fill": "#d9d9df",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 76.78,
              "content": "Agister runs what settings define and records it. Committing, pushing, deciding what a review's findings mean and asking the owner stay with whoever calls it. It does not yet run a branch or repeat inside a parallel, or a turn on pi; check and run refuse them alike.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Helvetica Neue",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "IEU24",
              "name": "spacer",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 36,
              "layout": "none"
            },
