                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "kv01C",
                  "name": "Section call",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": [
                    28,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "dK6Rd",
                      "name": "H2 call",
                      "fill": "$text",
                      "content": "A call",
                      "fontFamily": "$display",
                      "fontSize": 28,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hFt5X",
                      "name": "P call",
                      "fill": "$text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A call is one step executed. core/admit holds its worktree first, as a reader or a writer, checks a pinned revision and a clean worktree where the process asks, and keeps the call to its limits and the day's budget. core/call then makes turns on the runtime through its wrapper and the supervisor, which starts the program, keeps the ends of its output and ends its whole group.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "Pxx5H",
                      "name": "Turns",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "q8u1T",
                          "name": "Turn capacity",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "top": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            12,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "j0IndJ",
                              "name": "Turn key capacity",
                              "fill": "$step",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 110,
                              "content": "capacity",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "N5qAl8",
                              "name": "Turn text capacity",
                              "fill": "$text-body",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "A turn at capacity is made again, after 30 s, 1, 3 and 5 minutes, each telling the session to go on; then the call starts fresh on its agent's fallback, if it names one.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "r9ApG",
                          "name": "Turn stale",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "top": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            12,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "n5s7r",
                              "name": "Turn key stale",
                              "fill": "$step",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 110,
                              "content": "stale",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "EVwWa",
                              "name": "Turn text stale",
                              "fill": "$text-body",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "A turn that goes stale is followed by a recovery turn in its session, where the process allows a resume.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "iI2QS",
                          "name": "Turn session",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "top": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            12,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "eN6Tf",
                              "name": "Turn key session",
                              "fill": "$step",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 110,
                              "content": "session",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Uf55M",
                              "name": "Turn text session",
                              "fill": "$text-body",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "A call may continue an earlier step's session, by a binding; it goes on from where that session's latest call left the worktree.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "K161vT",
                          "name": "Turn cost",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "top": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            12,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "jCC3e",
                              "name": "Turn key cost",
                              "fill": "$step",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 110,
                              "content": "cost",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Q3VtOk",
                              "name": "Turn text cost",
                              "fill": "$text-body",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Each turn counts its own cost, claude-code's as reported, codex's priced through ccusage, against the process's limit and the daily budget.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "DGUOh",
                      "name": "P call end",
                      "fill": "$text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "At its end a call keeps the HEAD and content it left, and, where it pinned a revision, its changes as a patch.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "lkdAJ",
                  "name": "Section record",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": [
                    28,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HUfFX",
                      "name": "H2 record",
                      "fill": "$text",
                      "content": "What a run leaves",
                      "fontFamily": "$display",
                      "fontSize": 28,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nMtKi",
                      "name": "P folder",
                      "fill": "$text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Each run is a folder under ~/.agister/runs, named by its id: its start's UTC time and six random hex characters.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$sans",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "J17eW1",
                      "name": "Run folder",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "fill": "$surface",
                      "cornerRadius": 6,
                      "stroke": "$line",
                      "strokeWidth": 1,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "padding": [
                        6,
                        20
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "U1vQ4X",
                          "name": "File record.json",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "bottom": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            14,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "GZKPA",
                              "name": "Path record.json",
                              "fill": "$run",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 130,
                              "content": "record.json",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ut9RU",
                              "name": "Holds record.json",
                              "fill": "$text-sub",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The request, status and result. Every call ended, as <run id>/<step>, with its process, agent, inputs, permission plan, environment, definition files by digest, HEAD and content, cost and result. Under children, each child run, as <run id>/<item>, with its workflow, params, inputs and their identities, status and output. Written whole as each call ends; lost until the run ends.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "IV9Ja",
                          "name": "File events.jsonl",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "bottom": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            14,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "BPkCG",
                              "name": "Path events.jsonl",
                              "fill": "$run",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 130,
                              "content": "events.jsonl",
                              "fontFamily": "$mono",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "yvKvx",
                              "name": "Holds events.jsonl",
                              "fill": "$text-sub",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "A line per event as it happens: a step started, reused, a tool call, a stale turn, a turn at capacity, a fallback, a step ended; a branch's arm with each condition read; a repeat's pass with its state, and why it stopped; a child run started, with its params and inputs, and ended, with its status and output.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
                              "fontFamily": "$sans",
                              "fontSize": 14,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "NIzTv",
                          "name": "File definitions/",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$line-soft",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "bottom": 1
                          },
                          "gap": 24,
                          "padding": [
                            14,
                            0
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
